{
  "abstract": "The exponential generating function A(x) of OEIS A368630 satisfies A(0) = 1 and A(x/A(x)^2) = exp(x A(x)). The package proves that this equation determines a unique integer coefficient sequence, and that a(n) ≡ 1 (mod 3) for every n, a(2n) is odd for every n, and a(2n+1) is even for n ≥ 1, as conjectured by Paul D. Hanna (OEIS A368630, 2024).",
